{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.ai.the-oracle-problem","title":"The Oracle Problem dalam AI Coding","description":"Masalah menentukan 'jawaban benar' (ground truth) ketika biaya menulis kode dan test skeleton sudah menjadi sangat murah berkat AI.","tags":["ai-verification","ldd","testing"],"custom":{"description":"Masalah menentukan 'jawaban benar' (ground truth) ketika biaya menulis kode dan test skeleton sudah menjadi sangat murah berkat AI."},"fname":"zettel.ai.the-oracle-problem","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"64aa849bb96c904c74c5a64183b4b9e4","updated":1782198660430,"created":1782198660430,"desc":"","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.ai.the-oracle-problem","id":"zettel.ai.the-oracle-problem","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.ai-verification","alias":"ai-verification","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.ai-verification"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.ai.the-oracle-problem","id":"zettel.ai.the-oracle-problem","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.ldd","alias":"ldd","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.ldd"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.ai.the-oracle-problem","id":"zettel.ai.the-oracle-problem","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.testing","alias":"testing","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.testing"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.ai.the-oracle-problem","id":"zettel.ai.the-oracle-problem","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.ai-engineering.loop-driven-development","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":3,"offset":1143},"end":{"line":19,"column":51,"offset":1191},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.ai-engineering.loop-driven-development"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.ai.the-oracle-problem","id":"zettel.ai.the-oracle-problem","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"zettel.ai.separation-of-maker-and-checker","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":3,"offset":1249},"end":{"line":20,"column":48,"offset":1294},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"zettel.ai.separation-of-maker-and-checker"}},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.ai.behavior-coverage-vs-code-coverage","id":"zettel.ai.behavior-coverage-vs-code-coverage","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":3,"offset":1327},"end":{"line":21,"column":35,"offset":1359},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.ai.the-oracle-problem"}],"anchors":{"konsep":{"type":"header","text":"Konsep","value":"konsep","line":15,"column":0,"depth":2},"solusi-oracle-driven-feedback":{"type":"header","text":"Solusi: Oracle-Driven Feedback","value":"solusi-oracle-driven-feedback","line":20,"column":0,"depth":2},"bentuk-oracle":{"type":"header","text":"Bentuk Oracle","value":"bentuk-oracle","line":26,"column":0,"depth":2},"relasi":{"type":"header","text":"Relasi","value":"relasi","line":31,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"5u5qgf55dk7a3bauxh68b69","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"the-oracle-problem-dalam-ai-coding\">The Oracle Problem dalam AI Coding<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#the-oracle-problem-dalam-ai-coding\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"konsep\">Konsep<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#konsep\"></a></h2>\n<p><strong>The Oracle Problem</strong> muncul ketika kemampuan AI untuk menghasilkan implementasi dan test scaffolding melampaui kemampuan manusia (atau sistem) untuk menentukan apakah output tersebut benar-benar benar secara domain.</p>\n<p>Dalam TDD tradisional, manusia adalah oracle. Dalam AI-driven development, jika AI menulis kode sekaligus menulis test-nya, terjadi <em>self-justification</em> (AI membuat test yang membenarkan kodenya sendiri).</p>\n<h2 id=\"solusi-oracle-driven-feedback\">Solusi: Oracle-Driven Feedback<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#solusi-oracle-driven-feedback\"></a></h2>\n<p>Untuk memecahkan masalah ini, feedback dalam loop AI harus berasal dari sumber yang:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Independen</strong>: Tidak berasal dari agent yang menulis kode.</li>\n<li><strong>Deterministic</strong>: Input yang sama selalu menghasilkan output yang sama.</li>\n<li><strong>Queryable</strong>: Bisa ditanya untuk input baru secara spesifik.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"bentuk-oracle\">Bentuk Oracle<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#bentuk-oracle\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Sistem Referensi (Mimicry)</strong>: Menggunakan software yang sudah mapan sebagai sumber kebenaran (misal: menggunakan real Postgres untuk memvalidasi parser SQL baru).</li>\n<li><strong>Conformance Suites</strong>: Menggunakan kumpulan test standar industri (misal: Test262 untuk JS).</li>\n<li><strong>Human-Defined Behavior</strong>: Manusia menentukan output spesifik untuk edge case krusial.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"relasi\">Relasi<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#relasi\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.ai-engineering.loop-driven-development\">Loop Driven Development (LDD): Solving the Oracle Problem</a>: LDD adalah metodologi untuk mengelola oracle problem.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.ai.separation-of-maker-and-checker\">Pemisahan Maker dan Checker dalam Verifikasi AI</a>: Solusi fundamental untuk menghindari self-justification.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ai-verification (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ldd (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">testing (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.ai.behavior-coverage-vs-code-coverage\">Behavior Coverage vs Code Coverage</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel fr